        <ul class="text-body-sm text-muted flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-m-blue-light shrink-0">→</span> Fatores CO₂ do Quarto Estudo de GEE da OMI (2020)</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-m-blue-light shrink-0">→</span> Fatores NOx assumem carga moderada do motor (75% MCR)</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-m-blue-light shrink-0">→</span> Fatores SOx assumem 0,5% de enxofre (global) para HFO, 0,1% para MGO/MDO</li>
